><surname>Krajewski</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Krajewska</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Welsh</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Down-regulation of survivin by antisense oligonucleotides increases apoptosis, inhibits cytokinesis and anchorage-independent growth</article-title><source>Neoplasia</source><volume>2</volume><year>2000</year><fpage>235</fpage><lpage>241</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10935509</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Cookeetal1987"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cooke</surname><given-names>C.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Heck</surname><given-names>M.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Earnshaw</surname><given-names>W.C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The inner centromere protein (INCENP) antigensmovement from inner centromere to midbody during mitosis</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol</source><volume>105</volume><year>1987</year><fpage>2053</fpage><lpage>2067</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3316246</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DeverauxandReed1999"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Deveraux</surname><given-names>Q.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Reed</surname><given-names>J.C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>IAP family proteins-suppressors of apoptosis</article-title><source>Genes Dev.</source><volume>13</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>239</fpage><lpage>252</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9990849</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="EarnshawandBernat1991"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Earnshaw</surname><given-names>W.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernat</surname><given-names>R.L.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chromosomal passengerstoward an integrated view of mitosis</article-title><so